---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Support" description="Get help with Posato on Mac and iPhone.">
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>Support</h1>
    <p class="lead">Send questions, problems, or ideas about Posato on Mac or iPhone through the channels below.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Bugs and ideas, in public: <a href="https://github.com/dees91/posato/issues">GitHub Issues</a></li>
      <li>Private help with Posato: <a href="mailto:support@posato.app">support@posato.app</a></li>
      <li>Privacy questions: <a href="mailto:privacy@posato.app">privacy@posato.app</a></li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Share only what you need to describe the problem. GitHub Issues are public, so leave out your website
      lists, app names, and device details there. You don't need to send screenshots or logs by e-mail either.
      Replies are best effort.
    </p>

    <h2>Security</h2>
    <p>
      Report a security vulnerability privately with the <a href="https://github.com/dees91/posato/security/advisories/new">Report a vulnerability</a> form on GitHub, not in a public issue.
      The <a href="https://github.com/dees91/posato/blob/main/SECURITY.md">security policy</a> describes what to include.
    </p>

    <h2>Before you write</h2>
    <p>
      The <a href="/limits/">limits</a> cover browser coverage, VPN and Private Relay behavior, resuming after sleep, and data recovery.
    </p>
    <p>
      You can always end a session early or remove Posato. See the <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a> for what Posato keeps on your devices and in iCloud.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
